 ## Background
-The standard perspective projection model was introduced in the original 3D Gaussian Splatting paper [Kerbl et al., 2023]. The affine camera approximation for satellite imagery was introduced in "Gaussian Splatting for Efficient Satellite Image Photogrammetry" [S1] to handle Rational Polynomial Coefficient (RPC) models efficiently. Differentiable DOF rendering and Fisheye-GS are extensions developed to handle specific optical phenomena not covered by the standard pinhole camera model.
